          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">CNO Perspective Report by Rhonda Collins, DNP, RN, FAAN</span></p>\n<p>The nursing industry today is facing a staffing shortage unlike any it has seen before. In her latest CNO Perspective report, Rhonda Collins, DNP, RN, FAAN, lays out six ways to address nurses’ call for innovation and improving the work environment to help turn the tide.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.vocera.com/cno-report\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">DOWNLOAD THE 2022 REPORT</span></a></p>\n",
